      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلْوَى بِالكَلَامِ</span></b>  <i>He distorted, wrested,</i> or <i>wrung,
the language.</i> (M, K.) [Hence, perhaps, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يُلْوِى بِخَصْمِهِ</span>, if the verb be correctly thus: see
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُقْمِىَ</span>, last sentence.]

